<title>PHILIPPINES: Azucarera de Pilar to shift into gaming.</title>
<headline>Azucarera de Pilar to shift into gaming.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stockholders of sugar refiner turned holding firm Central Azucarera de Pilar approved plans to take at least a majority stake in Philippine Gaming and Management Corp, Azucarera de Pilar said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
